* Added sklearn to dependencies; changed runtime_max in settings_manager (3600).
* Added exception handling to config.get_output_directory and
  config.get_simulation_parameters_dir.
* Updated standard values dictionary; fixed parameter-name conflicts.
* Rewrote tempest regression functions and plots; moved them to plot_manager.
* Added script to extract plots to Data/00_Tempest_regression_plots.
* Parameter-space exploration runs locally; created explore_u_parameter_space.

## Version 0.2.3 — 2025-01-29 — pietro gerletti

* Wrote test for HPC_runme.
* Added MAX_PARALLEL_SIMULATIONS env variable to config; updated the
  multiprocessing runner env name.
* Updated slurm runner for the new unit_run signature.
* New tests and runners work.

## Version 0.2.2 — 2025-01-24 — pietro gerletti

* Updated setup.py and yml env file; corrected import paths.
* Made runme.py signatures consistent with tests.
* Added exception handling in output_manager.setup_output_directory and
  settings_manager.read_settings_and_write_simulation_parameters.
* Implemented and tested complete tests for the local serial and multiprocessing
  runners.

## Version 0.2.1 — 2025-01-17 — pietro gerletti

* Commented out the slurm part of fixtures to run locally.
* Implemented test for single seeded simulation.
* Fixed ghost-Data-folder bug (Data created in working directory; use
  config.set_data_dir(path) to change).
* Moved create-population into simulation.py and sequencing-dataset writing into
  output_manager.
* Fixed wrong output path and unsaved-plot bugs; moved plots to plots_manager.
* Renamed output variables for consistency (variant_inf_count → lineage_frequency).
* Implemented plotting from saved data files; tested and debugged.
* Fixed infection tree and wrote tests for it; tree no longer stores the full
  sequence (available from individuals_data.csv).
* Updated Nexus tree export; wrote test for phylogenetic tree (built from
  phylogenetic_data.csv).
* Fixed fasta writing and the genome decoder (all mutations introduced when
  decoding).
* Implemented tree-builder module; created tree tests.
* Fixed variable-name conflict in tree rendering.
* Created and tested new runme for local machines.

## Version 0.2.0 — 2024-09-12 — jbescudie

* Refactoring: decoupled core modules from managers (simulation.Simplicity still
  depends on output_manager).
* Added runners API + 3 implementations (serial, multiprocessing, slurm).
* Added test suite (currently only single-experiment).
